# Evaluation harness — ignore large datasets + regenerable run outputs, but
# keep the CRS baseline source (eval/crsbench/) in git. CSIC 2010 is
# re-downloadable (see docs/EVALUATION.md); results rebuild via
# `go run ./cmd/wafbench` + scripts/eval_ood_v7.py.
eval/datasets/
eval/results/

